  "caption_questionnaire": "Figure 5.8. Paired ratings for five questionnaire items in first-person VR (R03) and shared overhead VR (R04). Each row is one participant; circles and squares show the two raw ratings, connected within that participant. A square inside a circle indicates equal ratings. All 12 participants have both responses for these items (24 VR questionnaires from the confirmed 48-response dataset). Q04 concerns explaining an intended placement, Q06 knowing puzzle progress, Q09 moving a piece to an intended location, Q10 rotating it to an intended orientation, and Q12 feeling that the puzzle was solved together. Ratings use the full 1–5 scale; no combined score is calculated. The rounds occurred in a fixed order with different patterns and prototype versions. G02 ratings refer to the original session, not the later replay recording.",
  "caption_history": "Figure 3.1. Development of the research focus and study design. The August feedback called for a comparable task family while retaining the possibility of individual and joint work. The September discussion selected Tangram across the tasks. The final four-condition study is shown separately from those earlier plans. Sources: original project brief, early study plan, August thesis plan and supervisor response, 1 September meeting transcript, and final study procedure.",
